Package: sorenR
Title: Experimental Self-Organizing Representations with Bounded Updates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits experimental self-organizing representations with
    evolving neighborhoods (SOREN), a prototype codebook and mutual-neighbor
    graph implemented in pure R. Models have a deterministic out-of-sample
    map, frozen preprocessing, bounded replay memory and transactional
    updates that are checked against a finite-anchor displacement budget.
    Support scores are uncalibrated and methodological superiority is not
    established.
